&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day billing operations for Custody and Prime, including invoicing accuracy, the monthly close, and the billing ticket queue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop the billing operations team and coordinate BPO support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive billing and collections automation, including AI-assisted drafting and ticket triage, to improve cycle time, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Revenue Accounting, FP&amp;amp;A, Engineering, and Sales on billing systems and the migration from Salesforce to the Prime platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute and maintain evidence for billing-related SOX controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in billing, revenue, or finance operations, including direct process ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading or mentoring teammates and managing operational queues to SLA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of billing and invoicing systems and reconciliation, with hands-on experience in NetSuite, Salesforce, or comparable tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of improving operational processes through automation and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working familiarity with SOX controls and the financial close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
