&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Communications Manager, Policy &amp;amp; Public Affairs to join our Communications team and lead the narratives that shape how the public, press, and policymakers understand crypto. This team sits at the center of Coinbase&#39;s highest-stakes regulatory and legislative moments, translating complex policy positions into clear, compelling stories that win public support. You&#39;ll own our policy communications strategy end to end, serving as the primary architect of narratives that connect crypto to financial freedom and consumer choice across the US political landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the communications strategy for high-stakes legislative and regulatory initiatives, ensuring Coinbase has a clear, consistent voice across every policy moment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with legal and policy teams to translate complex litigation, regulatory filings, and policy positions into winning public narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead earned media execution by leveraging deep relationships with national political, financial, and technology journalists to drive proactive coverage and manage rapid-response cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive digital communications across X and other social platforms to speak directly to policymakers, thought leaders, and the crypto community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape advocacy communications that elevate consumer voices and demonstrate the real-world impact of pro-innovation policy to legislators and regulators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build long-term brand authority by maintaining Coinbase&#39;s position as the most trusted leader in the crypto space through multiple election and regulatory cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in high-stakes political communications, including direct experience in Congressional offices, political campaigns, or agency rapid-response environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record as an on-the-record spokesperson managing high-pressure national media inquiries with consistent, disciplined messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to drive news cycles and move public opinion through X and other digital platforms, with a portfolio of measurable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep fluency in the US regulatory and legislative landscape, with experience translating policy complexity into accessible public narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of building and maintaining relationships with Tier 1 political and financial journalists that consistently result in earned coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
