&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;As a Derivatives Sales Analyst on the STP team, you&#39;ll accelerate Coinbase Advanced&#39;s derivatives growth across APAC by originating and expanding relationships with VIP traders and institutions. You&#39;ll own the full sales cycle from prospecting through onboarding, operating with significant autonomy to deliver measurable market share and revenue growth in one of the most dynamic crypto trading regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end business development for derivatives in APAC, from client origination through negotiation, onboarding, and ongoing account management to maximize trading volumes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive targeted sales strategies that grow market penetration and revenue across VIP clients, crypto-native high-volume traders, and institutional accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a disciplined pipeline in CRM with consistent tracking, timely follow-up, and transparent reporting against revenue and volume targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with product, marketing, compliance, and operations to deliver client-centric solutions tailored for APAC markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Coinbase&#39;s presence at client meetings, industry events, and conferences across the region as a senior market ambassador.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape Coinbase&#39;s competitive positioning and product roadmap by capturing and sharing market intelligence from client interactions and regional trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years in derivatives sales, sales and trading, or business development at a tier-1 financial institution, cryptocurrency exchange, or fintech, with a focus on APAC markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven origination track record with existing relationships among VIP derivatives traders (crypto or traditional finance) in APAC, demonstrated by measurable revenue or volume growth in prior roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of derivatives market structure, product types (perpetuals, options, futures), and risk management principles sufficient to consult with sophisticated trading clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of independently closing complex, high-value deals and consistently exceeding revenue or volume targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel within APAC (up to approximately 30%) and English fluency (spoken and written).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
