&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own all aspects of monthly accounting close for the FCM and Broker-Dealer entities, including journal entries, account reconciliations, financial statement preparation, and quarterly/annual financial results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive timely submission of all required regulatory reporting to the CFTC, NFA, and other applicable agencies, ensuring daily filing deadlines are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead internal and external audit processes for the registered FCM and Broker-Dealer entities, coordinating evidence requests and managing audit timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute and maintain internal controls over compliance, regulatory reporting, and accounting policies and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, engineering, operations, and legal teams to drive accounting readiness for new product launches and evolving business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen daily monitoring of entity liquidity and capital requirements, escalating material issues to stakeholders promptly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS in Accounting or related field with active CPA certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7 years of public accounting (Big 4 preferred) and/or industry experience within brokerage, FCM, or other regulated financial services organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of FINRA/SEC broker-dealer rules, CFTC/NFA regulations for registered FCMs, and relevant accounting guidance including ASC 815 (Derivatives and Hedging) and 17 CFR 1.20 (customer fund protection).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience managing regulatory filings, audit cycles, and multiple concurrent reporting deadlines in a compliance-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work EST hours to meet daily regulatory filing deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
