&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;As a Senior Account Manager on the STP Account Management team, you&#39;ll serve as the primary relationship owner for Coinbase Institutional&#39;s highest-priority clients, ensuring they maximize the value of the Coinbase Prime platform across custody, trading, staking, and stablecoin services. You&#39;ll own end-to-end client coverage for complex institutional accounts including asset managers, banks, and corporates, driving adoption, retention, and revenue growth through consultative support and cross-functional coordination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a book of high-priority institutional client relationships end-to-end, from onboarding through ongoing account management, ensuring clients are fully integrated and actively using the Coinbase Prime product suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive client adoption and trading volume growth by identifying upsell and cross-sell opportunities across custody, trading, staking, and stablecoin services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales, Trading, Legal, Compliance, and Operations to resolve complex client needs, coordinate onboarding, and deliver client-centric solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead product demonstrations and technical walkthroughs with clients, serving as the subject matter expert on Coinbase&#39;s institutional capabilities and platform features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute disciplined pipeline and account management in CRM, including triaging incoming requests, prioritizing by impact, and driving issues through to resolution with limited escalation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape Coinbase&#39;s institutional product roadmap by distilling client feedback, surfacing feature requests, and translating usage patterns into actionable insights for Product and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years managing institutional client relationships in financial services, cryptocurrency exchanges, or fintech, with demonstrated ownership of complex, multi-product accounts (asset managers, banks, corporates, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of driving measurable growth in client adoption, trading volume, or revenue within an assigned book of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience managing full client lifecycles for institutional products (prime brokerage, custody, trading, or staking), including onboarding, integration support, and ongoing coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to coordinate across Sales, Operations, Legal, and Product teams to resolve complex client issues and deliver results without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in Mandarin (spoken and written) in addition to English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
