&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;As a Staff Product Designer on the Advanced Trade team within the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Consumer &amp;amp; Business&lt;/a&gt; group, you&#39;ll shape the future of Coinbase&#39;s most sophisticated trading experiences and give millions of traders the speed, confidence, and control they expect from a best-in-class platform. You&#39;ll join a distributed design team working across desktop and mobile surfaces, from portfolio and charting to derivatives, spot margin, and other high-complexity workflows. In this role, you&#39;ll lead zero-to-one initiatives, drive high-impact improvements, and raise the overall quality and craft of the Advanced Trading experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end product design for key Advanced Trade experiences across web and mobile, from discovery and concepting through prototyping, specs, iteration, and launch quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-ambiguity, zero-to-one and improvement initiatives across advanced trading surfaces, including derivatives, spot margin, structured products, portfolio, and modular UI evolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design scalable frameworks, patterns, and information architecture for complex, data-dense workflows so advanced traders can move with clarity in high-stakes moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the craft and quality bar across the Advanced Trading product surface, bringing UI and interaction quality to what best-in-class industry products deliver in 2026 and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Engineering, Research, and cross-functional peers to define problems, evaluate tradeoffs, and ship thoughtful, high-impact work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and uplevel junior designers, contribute strong opinions across the design org, and extend your impact beyond a single project or feature area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience designing digital products, including meaningful time in complex, data-dense, workflow-heavy, or tools-oriented environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of operating autonomously with limited oversight in fast-moving, ambiguous environments, with demonstrated end-to-end product design range from concept through launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead through influence, shape direction, and coach less experienced designers without formal management responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated proficiency in Figma and modern prototyping workflows, with a portfolio showing visual design, interaction design, and systems thinking at a high level of craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective cross-functional communication with Product and Engineering partners, with a track record of navigating tradeoffs and aligning stakeholders on complex, collaborative work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
