&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Work closely with critical T0/T1 services to understand architecture, improve scalability and reliability, and reduce operational toil.&lt;/li&gt;
